an> <span begin="00:18.235" end="00:18.506">too</span> <span begin="00:18.506" end="00:18.845">cold,</span> <span begin="00:18.845" end="00:19.002">so</span> <span begin="00:19.002" end="00:19.154">hold</span> <span begin="00:19.154" end="00:19.358">me</span> <span begin="00:19.358" end="00:19.627">tight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">零下三十度，冷得够呛，抱紧我</span></p><p begin="00:21.038" end="00:23.390" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:21.038" end="00:21.216">Will</span> <span begin="00:21.216" end="00:21.388">I</span> <span begin="00:21.388" end="00:21.662">see</span> <span begin="00:21.662" end="00:21.912">you</span> <span begin="00:21.912" end="00:22.141">at</span> <span begin="00:22.141" end="00:22.403">the</span> <span begin="00:22.403" end="00:22.630">show</span> <span begin="00:22.630" end="00:22.880">to</span><span begin="00:22.880" end="00:23.390">night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今晚的演出能见到你吗？</span></p><p begin="00:24.845" end="00:27.227" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:24.845" end="00:25.119">Will</span> <span begin="00:25.119" end="00:25.344">I</span> <span begin="00:25.344" end="00:25.563">see</span> <span begin="00:25.563" end="00:25.796">you</span> <span begin="00:25.796" end="00:25.985">at</span> <span begin="00:25.985" end="00:26.297">the</span> <span begin="00:26.297" end="00:26.556">show</span> <span begin="00:26.556" end="00:26.776">to</span><span begin="00:26.776" end="00:27.227">night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今晚的演出能见到你吗？</span></p><p begin="00:30.723" end="00:34.893" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:30.723" end="00:31.082">Ayy,</span> <span begin="00:33.212" end="00:33.572">truck</span> <span begin="00:33.572" end="00:33.688">to</span> <span begin="00:33.688" end="00:33.888">the</span> <span begin="00:33.888" end="00:34.265">plane</span> <span begin="00:34.265" end="00:34.382">to</span> <span begin="00:34.382" end="00:34.624">the</span> <span begin="00:34.624" end="00:34.893">truck</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">耶，卡车接去机场，下飞机又换卡车（Drake此处玩双关：既指出行路线是卡车-飞机-卡车，也暗讽自己不用豪车改开卡车、反差感拉满，还调侃自己“能力超群”能带人“飞”）</span></p><p begin="00:35.096" end="00:37.027" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:35.096" end="00:35.498">Truck</span> <span begin="00:35.498" end="00:35.634">to</span> <span begin="00:35.634" end="00:35.842">the</span> <span begin="00:35.842" end="00:36.186">ho</span><span begin="00:36.186" end="00:36.556">tel</span> <span begin="00:36.556" end="00:36.874">lob</span><span begin="00:36.874" end="00:37.027">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">卡车直抵酒店大堂</span></p><p begin="00:37.027" end="00:39.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:37.027" end="00:37.213">Me,</span> <span begin="00:37.213" end="00:37.416">I</span> <span begin="00:37.416" end="00:37.595">go</span> <span begin="00:37.595" end="00:37.859">through</span> <span begin="00:37.859" end="00:38.026">un</span><span begin="00:38.026" end="00:38.207">der</span><span begin="00:38.207" end="00:38.378">ground</span> <span begin="00:38.378" end="00:38.567">ga</span><span begin="00:38.567" end="00:38.795">ra</span><span begin="00:38.795" end="00:39.063">ges</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我专走地下车库通道（低调避人，不想被路人认出）</span></p><p begin="00:39.063" end="00:40.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:39.063" end="00:39.205">Pre</span><span begin="00:39.205" end="00:39.389">si</span><span begin="00:39.389" end="00:39.560">den</span><span begin="00:39.560" end="00:39.756">tial</span> <span begin="00:39.756" end="00:40.057">suite</span> <span begin="00:40.222" end="00:40.320">on</span> <span begin="00:40.320" end="00:40.509">de</span><span begin="00:40.509" end="00:40.806">po</span><span begin="00:40.806" end="00:40.990">sit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">总统套房已经订好</span></p><p begin="00:40.990" end="00:42.738" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:40.990" end="00:41.164">E</span><span begin="00:41.164" end="00:41.325">le</span><span begin="00:41.325" end="00:41.487">va</span><span begin="00:41.487" end="00:41.691">tor</span> <span begin="00:41.691" end="00:41.942">up</span> <span begin="00:42.069" end="00:42.229">to</span> <span begin="00:42.229" end="00:42.419">the</span> <span begin="00:42.419" end="00:42.738">room</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">电梯直抵客房</span></p><p begin="00:42.917" end="00:44.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:42.917" end="00:43.054">Sho</span><span begin="00:43.054" end="00:43.214">wer</span> <span begin="00:43.214" end="00:43.462">up</span> <span begin="00:43.462" end="00:43.653">and</span> <span begin="00:43.653" end="00:43.814">then</span> <span begin="00:43.814" end="00:43.985">we</span> <span begin="00:43.985" end="00:44.168">hit</span> <span begin="00:44.168" end="00:44.370">the</span> <span begin="00:44.370" end="00:44.681">club</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">冲完澡就去夜店嗨</span></p><p begin="00:44.820" end="00:46.634" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:44.820" end="00:45.189">Touch</span> <span begin="00:45.189" end="00:45.551">down,</span> <span begin="00:45.551" end="00:45.686">got</span><span begin="00:45.686" end="00:45.936">ta</span> <span begin="00:45.936" end="00:46.156">see</span> <span begin="00:46.156" end="00:46.355">what's</span> <span begin="00:46.355" end="00:46.634">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">落地了，得看看有啥好玩的</span></p><p begin="00:46.866" end="00:48.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:46.866" end="00:47.030">A</span><span begin="00:47.030" end="00:47.179">re</span><span begin="00:47.179" end="00:47.524">a</span> <span begin="00:47.524" end="00:47.857">code</span> <span begin="00:47.972" end="00:48.104">in</span> <span begin="00:48.104" end="00:48.317">my</span> <span begin="00:48.317" end="00:48.565">phone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我手机里还留着旧区号的号码</span></p><p begin="00:48.783" end="00:50.617" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:48.783" end="00:49.146">What</span> <span begin="00:49.146" end="00:49.264">num</span><span begin="00:49.264" end="00:49.549">bers</span> <span begin="00:49.549" end="00:49.695">do</span> <span begin="00:49.695" end="00:49.907">I</span> <span begin="00:49.907" end="00:50.185">still</span> <span begin="00:50.185" end="00:50.617">have?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还有哪些没删？</span></p><p begin="00:50.707" end="00:52.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:50.707" end="00:50.829">Who</span> <span begin="00:50.829" end="00:51.013">do</span> <span begin="00:51.013" end="00:51.299">I</span> <span begin="00:51.429" end="00:51.748">know</span> <span begin="00:51.748" end="00:51.960">from</span> <span begin="00:51.960" end="00:52.159">the</span> <span begin="00:52.159" end="00:52.501">past?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还有哪些旧相识？</span></p><p begin="00:52.698" end="00:54.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:52.698" end="00:53.027">Hit</span> <span begin="00:53.027" end="00:53.304">one,</span> <span begin="00:53.304" end="00:53.438">she</span> <span begin="00:53.438" end="00:53.617">say</span> <span begin="00:53.617" end="00:53.805">she</span> <span begin="00:53.805" end="00:53.977">got</span> <span begin="00:53.977" end="00:54.139">a</span> <span begin="00:54.139" end="00:54.463">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">打一个，她说自己已有伴儿</span></p><p begin="00:54.660" end="00:56.413" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:54.660" end="00:54.763">Hit</span> <span begin="00:54.763" end="00:55.001">a</span><span begin="00:55.001" end="00:55.145">no</span><span begin="00:55.145" end="00:55.351">ther</span> <span begin="00:55.351" end="00:55.596">one,</span> <span begin="00:55.596" end="00:55.714">it</span> <span begin="00:55.714" end="00:56.036">goes</span> <span begin="00:56.036" end="00:56.413">green</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">再打一个，消息提示变绿（苹果用户给非苹果用户发消息会显示绿色，说明对方换了手机/号码）</span></p><p begin="00:56.611" end="00:58.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:56.611" end="00:56.944">Must've</span> <span begin="00:56.944" end="00:57.292">changed</span> <span begin="00:57.292" end="00:57.734">phones</span> <span begin="00:57.734" end="00:57.877">on</span> <span begin="00:57.877" end="00:58.068">the</span> <span begin="00:58.068" end="00:58.416">team</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">肯定是换手机换号了</span></p><p begin="00:58.568" end="01:00.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:58.568" end="00:58.654">'Mem</span><span begin="00:58.654" end="00:58.867">ber</span> <span begin="00:58.867" end="00:59.036">when</span> <span begin="00:59.036" end="00:59.231">you</span> <span begin="00:59.231" end="00:59.404">let</span> <span begin="00:59.404" end="00:59.574">me</span> <span begin="00:59.574" end="00:59.719">in</span> <span begin="00:59.719" end="00:59.927">be</span><span begin="00:59.927" end="01:00.289">tween</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还记得你曾接纳我的那段日子吗</span></p><p begin="01:00.506" end="01:02.187" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:00.506" end="01:00.635">That</span> <span begin="01:00.635" end="01:00.828">was</span> <span begin="01:00.828" end="01:01.441">20</span><span begin="01:01.441" end="01:02.187">17</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是2017年了</span></p><p begin="01:02.372" end="01:04.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:02.372" end="01:02.754">All</span> <span begin="01:02.754" end="01:03.180">good,</span> <span begin="01:03.180" end="01:03.323">Chubbs</span> <span begin="01:03.323" end="01:03.516">will</span> <span begin="01:03.516" end="01:03.657">look</span> <span begin="01:03.657" end="01:03.882">a</span><span begin="01:03.882" end="01:04.250">round</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没事，查布斯（Drake的贴身保镖，真名Nessel Beezer）会帮我留意</span></p><p begin="01:04.460" end="01:06.174" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:04.460" end="01:04.775">Find</span> <span begin="01:04.775" end="01:05.026">one</span> <span begin="01:05.026" end="01:05.170">that</span> <span begin="01:05.170" end="01:05.470">seem</span> <span begin="01:05.470" end="01:05.806">my</span> <span begin="01:05.806" end="01:06.174">type</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">找几个合我眼缘的</span></p><p begin="01:06.373" end="01:08.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:06.373" end="01:06.524">That</span> <span begin="01:06.524" end="01:06.669">my</span> <span begin="01:06.669" end="01:06.885">dawg</span> <span begin="01:06.885" end="01:07.025">and</span> <span begin="01:07.025" end="01:07.240">he</span> <span begin="01:07.240" end="01:07.438">know</span> <span begin="01:07.438" end="01:07.626">what</span> <span begin="01:07.626" end="01:07.799">I</span> <span begin="01:07.799" end="01:08.083">like</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是我兄弟，他懂我的口味</span></p><p begin="01:08.324" end="01:10.031" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:08.324" end="01:08.460">He</span> <span begin="01:08.460" end="01:08.666">done</span> <span begin="01:08.666" end="01:08.811">found</span> <span begin="01:08.811" end="01:09.019">me</span> <span begin="01:09.019" end="01:09.175">plen</span><span begin="01:09.175" end="01:09.334">ty</span> <span begin="01:09.334" end="01:09.491">in</span> <span begin="01:09.491" end="01:09.621">my</span> <span begin="01:09.621" end="01:10.031">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他这辈子给我牵过不少线</span></p><p begin="01:10.208" end="01:11.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:10.208" end="01:10.389">Prob</span><span begin="01:10.389" end="01:10.561">lem</span> <span begin="01:10.561" end="01:10.746">is,</span> <span begin="01:10.746" end="01:10.926">I</span> <span begin="01:10.926" end="01:11.102">meet</span> <span begin="01:11.102" end="01:11.274">a</span> <span begin="01:11.274" end="01:11.452">girl</span> <span begin="01:11.452" end="01:11.681">to</span><span begin="01:11.681" end="01:11.971">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">问题是今晚我遇上个姑娘</span></p><p begin="01:12.225" end="01:13.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:12.225" end="01:12.322">Then</span> <span begin="01:12.322" end="01:12.496">I</span> <span begin="01:12.496" end="01:12.643">go</span> <span begin="01:12.643" end="01:12.919">and</span> <span begin="01:12.919" end="01:13.087">treat</span> <span begin="01:13.087" end="01:13.299">her</span> <span begin="01:13.299" end="01:13.592">too</span> <span begin="01:13.592" end="01:13.927">nice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">结果我忍不住对她太好</span></p><p begin="01:14.197" end="01:15.954" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:14.197" end="01:14.319">Gal</span><span begin="01:14.319" end="01:14.490">le</span><span begin="01:14.490" end="01:14.846">ria</span> <span begin="01:14.846" end="01:15.033">cre</span><span begin="01:15.033" end="01:15.184">dit</span> <span begin="01:15.184" end="01:15.563">card</span> <span begin="01:15.563" end="01:15.954">swipes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在加莱利亚（休斯顿知名高端商场）刷爆信用卡</span></p><p begin="01:16.193" end="01:17.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:16.193" end="01:16.260">I</span> <span begin="01:16.260" end="01:16.449">don't</span> <span begin="01:16.449" end="01:16.598">e</span><span begin="01:16.598" end="01:16.732">ven</span> <span begin="01:16.732" end="01:16.922">know</span> <span begin="01:16.922" end="01:17.144">if</span> <span begin="01:17.144" end="01:17.237">she</span> <span begin="01:17.237" end="01:17.494">a</span> <span begin="01:17.494" end="01:17.851">wife</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">甚至不知道她是不是有夫之妇</span></p><p begin="01:18.294" end="01:19.852" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:18.294" end="01:18.476">But</span> <span begin="01:18.476" end="01:18.641">I</span> <span begin="01:18.641" end="01:18.812">do</span> <span begin="01:18.812" end="01:19.046">know</span> <span begin="01:19.046" end="01:19.253">one</span> <span begin="01:19.253" end="01:19.500">thing</span> <span begin="01:19.500" end="01:19.852">though</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但有一件事我清楚</span></p><p begin="01:20.236" end="01:21.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:20.236" end="01:20.483">Wo</span><span begin="01:20.483" end="01:20.700">men,</span> <span begin="01:20.700" end="01:20.921">they</span> <span begin="01:20.921" end="01:21.171">come</span> <span begin="01:21.171" end="01:21.391">they</span> <span begin="01:21.391" end="01:21.782">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">女人来了又会走</span></p><p begin="01:22.132" end="01:23.889" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:22.132" end="01:22.299">Sa</span><span begin="01:22.299" end="01:22.435">tur</span><span begin="01:22.435" end="01:22.651">day</span> <span begin="01:22.651" end="01:22.897">through</span> <span begin="01:22.897" end="01:23.125">Sun</span><span begin="01:23.125" end="01:23.389">day,</span> <span begin="01:23.389" end="01:23.613">Mon</span><span begin="01:23.613" end="01:23.889">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">周六到周日，再到周一</span></p><p begin="01:24.142" end="01:25.697" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:24.142" end="01:24.348">Mon</span><span begin="01:24.348" end="01:24.590">day</span> <span begin="01:24.590" end="01:24.845">through</span> <span begin="01:24.845" end="01:25.096">Sun</span><span begin="01:25.096" end="01:25.328">day,</span> <span begin="01:25.328" end="01:25.697">yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">周一到周日，哟</span></p><p begin="01:26.069" end="01:27.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:26.069" end="01:26.329">May</span><span begin="01:26.329" end="01:26.566">be</span> <span begin="01:26.566" end="01:26.813">I'll</span> <span begin="01:26.813" end="01:27.045">love</span> <span begin="01:27.045" end="01:27.308">you</span> <span begin="01:27.308" end="01:27.534">one</span> <span begin="01:27.534" end="01:27.776">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说不定哪天我会爱上你</span></p><p begin="01:28.010" end="01:29.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:28.010" end="01:28.272">May</span><span begin="01:28.272" end="01:28.506">be</span> <span begin="01:28.506" end="01:28.756">we'll</span> <span begin="01:28.756" end="01:29.030">some</span><span begin="01:29.030" end="01:29.272">day</span> <span begin="01:29.272" end="01:29.637">grow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说不定我们会有未来</span></p><p begin="01:29.976" end="01:32.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:29.976" end="01:30.207">'Til</span> <span begin="01:30.207" end="01:30.443">then,</span> <span begin="01:30.443" end="01:30.669">I'll</span> <span begin="01:30.669" end="01:30.911">sit</span> <span begin="01:30.911" end="01:31.152">my</span> <span begin="01:31.152" end="01:31.386">drunk</span> <span begin="01:31.386" end="01:31.615">ass</span> <span begin="01:31.615" end="01:31.878">on</span> <span begin="01:31.878" end="01:32.149">that</span> <span begin="01:32.149" end="01:32.400">run</span><span begin="01:32.400" end="01:32.622">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那之前，我就坐我这喝醉的屁股在跑道上（化用Eminem《Superman》的歌词，Drake改得更有旋律感，这里的跑道指即将起飞的航班跑道，暗示他即将奔赴下一站）</span></p><p begin="01:32.622" end="01:33.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="01:32.622" end="01:32.880">On</span> <span begin="01:32.880" end="01:33.134">this</span> <span begin="01:33.134" end="01:33.366">one</span> <span begin="01:33.366" end="01:33.616">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在这条单行道上</span></p><p begin="01:34.093" end="01:37.529" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="01:34.093" end="01:34.678">Two</span><span begin="01:34.678" end="01:34.932">-thir</span><span begin="01:34.932" end="01:35.183">ty,</span> <span begin="01:35.183" end="01:35.420">ba</span><span begin="01:35.420" end="01:35.662">by,</span> <span begin="01:35.662" end="01:35.882">won't</span> <span begin="01:35.882" end="01:36.095">you</span> <span begin="01:36.095" end="01:36.336">meet</span> <span begin="01:36.336" end="01:36.563">me</span> <span begin="01:36.563" end="01:36.795">by</span> <span begin="01:36.795" end="01:37.067">The</span> <span begin="01:37.067" end="01:37.529">Bean?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">两点半，宝贝，你能在豆子（芝加哥标志性雕塑“云门”，俗称The Bean）那儿见我吗？</span></p><p begin="01:37.944" end="01:41.522" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="01:37.944" end="01:38.290">Too</span> <span begin="01:38.572" end="01:38.798">ear</span><span begin="01:38.798" end="01:39.042">ly,</span> <span begin="01:39.042" end="01:39.274">may</span><span begin="01:39.274" end="01:39.510">be</span> <span begin="01:39.510" end="01:39.703">la</span><span begin="01:39.703" end="01:39.962">ter</span> <span begin="01:39.962" end="01:40.155">you</span> <span begin="01:40.155" end="01:40.405">can</span> <span begin="01:40.405" end="01:40.662">show</span> <span begin="01:40.662" end="01:40.913">me</span> <span begin="01:40.913" end="01:41.522">things</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">太急了？那晚点你再给我看点不一样的也行</span></p><p begin="01:42.839" end="01:45.161" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="01:42.839" end="01:43.053">You</span> <span begin="01:43.053" end="01:43.179">know</span> <span begin="01:43.179" end="01:43.295">what</span> <span begin="01:43.295" end="01:43.438">it</span> <span begin="01:43.438" end="01:43.710">is</span> <span begin="01:43.710" end="01:43.851">whe</span><span begin="01:43.851" end="01:43.998">ne</span><span begin="01:43.998" end="01:44.115">ver</span> <span begin="01:44.115" end="01:44.361">I</span> <span begin=